    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="07789ae2-8af4-5c54-9d6c-714eab695b07" activityNameId="1a9be22f-fa60-5483-ba48-8db35e7af44a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Rolling mill</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Rolling mill
The values for plant area were taken from a map recieved during the visit to a electro-steel manufacturing and forming plant in Gerlafingen, Switzerland. The output was 616000 tonnes of formed steel in 2002. The Lifetime is assumed to be 50 years for infrastructure like buildings and routes, and 25 years for machinery and furnaces;
UUID: e27ffe1d-76ce-3787-9043-748219d8a21f
Includes land occupation data for and land transformation data to  buildings, asphalted and green surroundings; land transformation data from unknown;  the buildings; company internal roads, parking lots etc.; the main material of which the machinery is composed and their disposal.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: The visited plant produces hot rolled merchant bars, wire rod, concrete reinforcing bars, mats and cold rolled topar-S, topar-Rc and topar-Rs
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: plant map and estimation 
Extrapolations: see technology and geography
Uncertainty adjustments: The extrapolatin made for the description of the technology process, the geografical extrapolations, the estimations for machinery weight and the fact that no data were available about the percentage of companies represented by the study citated are considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e27ffe1d-76ce-3787-9043-748219d8a21f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
